    "ui.help.app.body": "The shift schedule (click to change the draft, Publish sends it out), swap and time-off requests, messages from @shiftella_bot, the board, checklists, the night digest and payroll.",
    "ui.help.app.title": "Shiftella (T)",
    "ui.help.build.body": "Pick a piece and click in the café. R rotates, X demolishes, Ctrl+Z undoes, right-click or Esc cancels. Lamps, plants and rugs lift the mood.",
    "ui.help.build.title": "Build (B)",
    "ui.help.crew.body": "Hire candidates, watch needs, skills and relationships. Letting someone go is one click — and Undo brings them back.",
    "ui.help.crew.title": "Crew (C)",
    "ui.help.events.body": "News pops up bottom right; choices wait while paused and settle themselves after a while. The log (L), or a click on the line at the top, shows what happened.",
    "ui.help.events.title": "Events and the log",
    "ui.help.money.body": "Sales and tips come in at night; wages and supplies go out. Debt payments show in the day plan. A clean, quick, cosy café earns a better reputation.",
    "ui.help.money.title": "Money, debt, reputation",
    "ui.help.night.body": "Space pauses, 1/2/3 set the speed, WASD and the wheel move the camera, Home shows the whole café. Hover a guest to see their wish; regulars sometimes want to talk.",
    "ui.help.night.title": "The night and the guests",
    "ui.help.priorities.body": "Rows are people, columns are jobs. 1 matters most, empty means never. Click raises, right-click or the wheel lowers.",
    "ui.help.priorities.title": "Priorities (P)",
    "ui.help.rhythm.body": "By day you plan (the clock stands still). At night, 22:00–06:00, the café runs. In the morning: a summary and an autosave. Enter starts the night.",
    "ui.help.rhythm.title": "Day and night",
    "ui.help.tip": "How to play (F1)",
    "ui.help.title": "How to play",
